<%# The reviewer-decision core (civora-org/civora-platform#90) shared by
    the two admin surfaces so their markup stays in sync — the
    redaction-confirmation-body precedent: the decided state, the
    decided-on date and the reason text. The reason is reviewer-typed free
    text — escaped output on purpose. `reviewed_at` is nil-guarded so a
    reason-present/timestamp-nil row (pre-#90-style data, a manual seed;
    the command stamps both atomically) renders the banner instead of
    raising. %>
<p>
  <strong><%= t(contract.state, scope: "decidim.contracts_sk.contract_states") %></strong>
  — <%= t("decidim.contracts_sk.admin.contracts.review_decision.decided_on",
          reviewed_at: format_date(contract.reviewed_at)) %>
</p>
<p><%= contract.review_reason %></p>
